{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "มิตะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "โอ้ รู้สึกตัวแล้วเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "เธอมานี่ได้ไง?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "เมื่อกี้เธอยังอยู่ข้างฉันอยู่เลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "ไม่ใช่นะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "คุณตัวแข็งอยู่หน้ากระจกน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "ฉันเลยเดินออกมาก่อน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "ทำไมห้องถึงเปลี่ยนไปล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "ฉันจัดใหม่น่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "เพื่อให้คุณรู้สึกเหมือนกับอยู่บ้าน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "ที่นี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "เราสามารถจัดเปลี่ยนห้องได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "ตามที่เราต้องการ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "เธอไม่ต้องทำแบบนั้นก็ได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "ฉันว่าฉันเริ่มชินกับมันแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "ฉันก็นึกว่าคุณจะสบายใจถ้าฉันจัดเรียงแบบนี้นี่นา"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "เอาล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "พร้อมเล่นหรือยัง?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "เกมจะเล่นแบบนี้นะ:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "ชิปนี้จะเอาไว้ระบุประเภทพลัง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "เช่นพลังชีวิต"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "เราจะต้องลงไพ่คนละ 1 ใบ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "ถ้าไพ่ของคุณ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "มีพลังชีวิตมากกว่า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "ไพ่ของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "คุณก็จะชนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "เอาล่ะ หยิบไพ่เลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "ฉันหยิบบ้างนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "ว้าว!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "ไพ่ฉันอย่างแจ่มเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "ฉันเริ่มก่อนนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "โอเค!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "ตาคุณแล้ว!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "อา-ฮะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "ตาคุณแล้วนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "คนที่มีพลังชีวิตสูงกว่าชนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "รอบนี้คือพลังโจมตี!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "ดูตรงพลังป้องกันนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "ชัยชนะเป็นของคุณ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "คุณชนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "คุณชนะฉันแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "โอ้ คุณ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "ฉันชนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "ฉันคือผู้ชนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "ชัยชนะเป็นของฉัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "ฉันชนะแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "เสมอกัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "พลังเท่ากัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "ตานี้เสมอกัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "พลังมันเท่ากัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// The card game is interrupted"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "นั่นเสียงอะไร?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "มันดังมาจากตู้เสื้อผ้า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "เสียงเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "เสียงอะไร?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "ฉันไม่เห็นได้ยินอะไรเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "เสียงมันเป็นยังไงเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "เสียงเหมือนคนเคาะน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "แต่ที่นี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "ไม่มีใครนอกจากเรานะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "ฉันจะลองไปเปิดดูหน่อย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "มันรู้สึกขนลุกแปลก ๆ น่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "ทำไมกัน...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "อีกแล้ว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "คุณจะทำอะไรน่ะ!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "ในตู้นี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "มันมีชุดชั้นในฉันอยู่นะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "เธอซ่อนอะไรอยู่กันแน่?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "ทำไมคุณถึงไม่เชื่อฉันล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "ฉันทำอะไรผิดงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "ฉันก็แค่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "อยากอยู่กับคุณเอง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "ฉันก็อยากจะอยู่นะ แต่ว่า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "ทำไมถึงเอาแต่สนใจตู้นั่นนักล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "ฉันแค่อยากรู้ว่าเสียงนั่นมันคืออะไร!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "หรือเป็นเพราะว่า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "โลกนี้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "มันมีอยู่แค่สี่ห้อง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "คุณเลยไม่พอใจใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "ขอร้องล่ะอยู่กับฉันเถอะนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Don't stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "เข้าใจแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "อีกแล้วสินะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "ถ้าอยากรู้ว่าในนั้นมีอะไรมากละก็"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "เอาเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "แล้วจะรู้ ว่าข้างในมันอันตราย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "อะไรเนี่ย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "มันจะเกิดขึ้นบางครั้ง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "ถ้าโหลดห้องไม่ทันน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "รออีกหน่อยนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "นี่มันแปลกจังแฮะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "เราอยู่ในโทรศัพท์ของใครบางคนเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "และโทรศัพท์เครื่องนี้ก็ช้ามาก ๆ ด้วยใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "ไม่ใช่หรอก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "ทุกอย่างในโลกนี้ไม่ได้สมบูรณ์แบบ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "ในโลกนี้น่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "พวกเราถูกโหลด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "ด้วยแกนกลางของโลก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "แกนกลางของโลกนี้เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "มันคือเรื่องธรรมดาน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "จริงด้วย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "เราจะเล่นคอนโซล"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "หรือ ไพ่ก็ได้นะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "คุณเลือกเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita play fight"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "พร้อมสู้ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "คุณจะต้องชนะฉันให้ได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "4 ครั้ง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "มาเริ่มกันเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "ไม่ต้องห่วง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "ตาแรกเดี๋ยวฉันอ่อนให้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "อย่างงั้นแหละ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "ตั้งใจแบบนี้ไว้นะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "โอ้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "โอเค..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "คราวนี้ฉันจะเอาจริงแล้วนะ!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "โอ๊ะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "งั้นคราวนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "คุณจะยังชนะฉันได้ไหม?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "คุณนี่มัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "สุดยอดจริง ๆ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "ใช้นิ้วเก่งเป็นบ้าเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "เป็นอะไรไปเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "หึ ไม่หนุกเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "เอ่อ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "คุณเชื่อเรื่องดวงไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "โอเค"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "ตั้งใจหน่อย ไม่งั้นคุณได้แพ้ไปตลอดชีวิตแน่!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "คุณเป็นอะไรไปเนี่ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "ฉันชนะจนไม่รู้จะชนะยังไงแล้วนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "พยายามหน่อยสิ—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "ไม่งั้นก็ไม่ชนะฉันหรอกนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "ถ้างั้น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "เราไปเล่นไพ่กันไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "ในห้องนอนฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Door > [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "หืม, เกิดอะไรขึ้น?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "มัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "โอ๊ะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "ขอโทษนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "ฉันดาวน์โหลดบางอย่าง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "จากเน็ตมาน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "อยากจะปรับแต่ง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "ข้างนอกหน่อยน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "แต่มันกลับ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "มีปัญหาบางอย่างกับไฟล์นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "เดี๋ยวฉันจะไปแก้ไขมันทีหลังนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "เพราะแบบนี้เราถึงออกไปนอกบ้านไม่ได้สินะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "ใช่เลย... นั่นแหละ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "เฮ้..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "คุณเป็นอะไรไปเนี่ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "คุณต้องการอะไรงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Wall Clock"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "นาฬิกานี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "บอกเวลาของที่ไหน?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "เวลาในเกมเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "หรือมันเชื่อมต่อกับเวลาโทรศัพท์ฉัน?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "เอ่อ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "ฉันก็ไม่รู้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "ไม่ว่าจะกี่โมง "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "หรือจะดึกแค่ไหน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "สาวสุดแกร่งอย่างฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "จะร่าเริงอยู่เสมอ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "ไม่เคยเหนื่อยเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "จะให้เป็นฤดูใบไม้ผลิไปตลอด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "หรือช่วงบ่ายไม่รู้จบก็ได้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "น่าสนใจ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "แต่ก็น่าขนลุกในเวลาเดียวกัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "ที่ต้องติดอยู่ในช่วงเวลาเดียวตลอดแบบนี้...."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Photos of Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "รูปสวยจัง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "ฉันว่านี่คงเป็นของเธอใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "ใช่แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "ฉันก็ชอบรูปนั้นเหมือนกัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "ใครเป็นคนถ่ายเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "ในโลกนี้ก็มีคนอื่นเหมือนกันเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "ถ้าพูดแบบนั้นก็ถูกนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "เดี๋ยวฉันจะพาคุณไปเจอพวกเขาเอง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "แค่ยังไม่ใช่ตอนนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "ตอนนี้ ฉันอยากอยู่กับคุณแค่สองคน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "ประตูมิติล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "หรืออะไรก็ตามที่เธอเรียกน่ะ... มันไปไหนแล้ว?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "ฉันใช้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "เวทมนตร์นิดหน่อย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "เพื่อย้ายมันไปที่อื่น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "ยังไงก็ตาม"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "เราคงไม่ต้องการมันแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "มันจะมาขวางทางเราเปล่า ๆ น่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Mirror in the bedroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "เวลามองกระจกแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "ไม่เห็นภาพสะท้อน—น่าขนลุกจังแฮะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "เราสามารถเปิดภาพสะท้อนได้นะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "ถ้าคุณอยากเปิด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "แต่คุณอยากให้เปิดจริง ๆ เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "แน่นอนสิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "หรือว่า... ถ้าเปิดแล้วจะมีผลกระทบอะไรหรือเปล่า?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "มีสิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "พวกเราจะกระตุกและเคลื่อนที่ช้าลง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "เคยดูการ์ตูนที่เฟรมเรตต่ำไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "ถ้าเปิดมันจะเป็นแบบนั้นตลอด..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "เข้าใจละ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "งั้นปิดไว้ดีกว่า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "นี่ [player]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "คุณดูชอบส่องกระจกจังนะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "คุณไม่กลัวว่าอยู่ ๆ จะเห็นตัวเองยิ้มเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "ไม่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "ฉันแค่เหนื่อย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "หลังจากทำงานมาหนักเฉย ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Blue sneakers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "นี่ของเธอเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "ไม่ใช่ ของคุณต่างหาก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "จำไม่ได้เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "ฉันไม่เห็นจำได้เลยว่ามีรองเท้าแบบนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "ก็คุณมีแล้วไง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "เอาไว้ใส่ตอน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "เราออกไปข้างนอก"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "แล้วเสื้อผ้าล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "ในโลกนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "ฉันมีแค่เสื้อผ้าที่ใส่อยู่ตอนนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "มีวิธีหาเสื้อใหม่ให้ฉันไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "แน่นอนว่ามีอยู่แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "แต่... ฉันเคยเห็นชุดที่คุณใส่แล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "บอกตรง ๆ เลยว่าเทสต์คุณนี่ไม่ได้เรื่องเลยนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "แต่ไม่เป็นไร ฉันจะช่วยคุณเอง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "แค่ยังไม่ใช่ตอนนี้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "ฉันสัญญา"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "โอเค"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Games on TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "เราจะเล่นเกมอะไรกันดี?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Game milk"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "ในเกมนี้พวกเราต้องสู้กัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "เพื่อวัดว่าใครสดกว่า!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "เกมนี้สนุกมากฉันบอกเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "เราเล่นเกมนี้กันพอแล้ว ไปทำอย่างอื่นกันดีกว่า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Game penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "ในเกมนี้ เราต้องเป็นนกเพนกวิน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "และสไลด์ไปรอบ ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "เอาล่ะ เราเล่นเกมนี้จบแล้ว!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "ว่าไงนะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "คุณพูดจริงเหรอ? ฉันนึกว่าคุณจะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "ดีใจจัง!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "อาจจะงง ๆ นิดหน่อย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "แต่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "ได้โปรดอยู่กับฉัน—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "ตลอดไปเลยนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// A game about penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "เกมนี้เล่นง่าย ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "แค่เก็บก้อนหิมะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "ใครที่มีก้อนหิมะเยอะที่สุดก็ชนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "เอาล่ะ มาเล่นกันสักสองตานะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// The first map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "ว้าว ไปเอาหิมะเยอะขนาดนี้มาจากไหนเนี่ย?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "อุ๊บ! ฉันมีหิมะมากกว่าล่ะ อิ ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "ตามฉันให้ทันล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "ฮ่า ๆ 1:1 ล่ะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// The second map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "คุณนี่เป็นนกเพนกวินโดยดำเนิดจริง ๆ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "ต้องพาคุณไปลองสไลด์บนน้ำแข็งจริง ๆ แล้วล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "อุ๊บ คุณนี่ช้าจังเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "นี่ไม่ได้เรียนรู้อะไรจากรอบก่อนเลยเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "ว้าว เสมอกัน! เรื่องจริงเหรอเนี่ย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// The game is over"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "งั้น เรามาเล่นเกมอื่นกันต่อไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "หรือคุณไม่อยากเลิกเล่นแล้ว?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "เอาไว้ทำอะไรเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "คุณเป็นพวกติดเกมหรือไง?"}
